        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file `summarize_text.py` that calls a hosted LLM to summarize long text, I need to choose a concrete external provider and make it identifiable in the code. I will use Amazon Bedrock, which is a suitable service for this task. The code will include the necessary imports and the provider-specific client class to make it identifiable. </thinking>\n",
